<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs028" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Light-ground closing: a short thanks or call to action, one line of next steps and a contact block; the ground matches the light cover.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="n5Rja2hEhD"><hr horizontalAlign="left" width="xs" thickness="md" color="accent"><h1 style="padding-right: 30%">Thank you</h1><p style="padding-right: 34%" font-size="lg">Decisions from today go to the regional managers on Friday; the plan is reviewed again in September.</p><spacer size="24pt"></spacer><p font-size="sm">Northwind Supply · plan@northwind.example · northwind.example</p></grid-item></grid></section>